rt : {T:away:sub} a gagné le match en le jouant dans le camp adverse."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:away:sub}: a PPDA of 5.3, against 11.1 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Reaction to losing it: {T:away:sub} win back 17% of lost balls within 5 s, against 6%. A pack.","Wyscout data: no pressure events, so pressing is read through tackles, interceptions and fouls."],"impact":"A win for the team that ran: {T:away:sub} won the game by playing it in the opponent's half."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Choc des philosophies : {T:away:sub} (−0,21) jouait autour du ballon, {T:home:sub} (−1,05) tenait ses postes.","keys":["Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : S. Davis, impliqué dans 34 passes entre titulaires.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : T. Kroos, impliqué dans 200 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football relationniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"Clash of philosophies: {T:away:sub} (−0.21) played around the ball, {T:home:sub} (−1.05) held their positions.","keys":["The hub of {T:home:pos} network: S. Davis, involved in 34 passes between starters.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: T. Kroos, involved in 200 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, relational football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Transitions sous contrôle des deux côtés : 2 tir(s) concédé(s) après une perte pour {T:home:sub}, 0 pour {T:away:sub}.","keys":["But encaissé en transition par {T:home:sub} : 29'. Le repli arrivait en retard.","Sans 360, on ne voit pas les courses de repli : seuls les tirs concédés racontent l'histoire."],"impact":"Personne n'a été puni en transition : le match s'est joué en attaque placée."},"en":{"lead":"Transitions under control on both sides: 2 shot(s) conceded after a loss for {T:home:sub}, 0 for {T:away:sub}.","keys":["Goal conceded in transition by {T:home:sub}: 29'. The recovery run came too late.","Without 360, recovery runs are invisible: only the shots conceded tell the story."],"impact":"Nobody got punished in transition: the match was decided in settled play."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Sans 360, on mesure l'attention reçue : J. Evans a subi 0,80 actions défensives de plus que la normale pour 10 touches.","keys":["G. McAuley ({T:home:bare}) : +0,74.","J. Hector ({T:away:bare}) : +0,29.","T. Müller ({T:away:bare}) : +0,17.","À l'autre bout, M. Gómez (−0,56) a joué dans un relatif anonymat : parfois, c'est exactement ce qu'on cherche."],"impact":"J. Evans a aspiré la défense, sans que personne n'en profite : de la gravité sans satellite."},"en":{"lead":"Without 360, we measure attention received: J. Evans drew 0.80 more defensive actions than normal per 10 touches.","keys":["G. McAuley ({T:home:sub}): +0.74.","J. Hector ({T:away:sub}): +0.29.","T. Müller ({T:away:sub}): +0.17.","At the other end, M. Gómez (−0.56) played in relative peace: sometimes that is exactly the point."],"impact":"J. Evans pulled the defence in, but nobody cashed in: gravity without a satellite."}},"s7":{"fr":{"lead":"Menace créée balle au pied et à la passe (xT) : 0,36 pour {T:home:sub}, 3,06 pour {T:away:sub}. Celui qui faisait avancer le ballon vers le danger : M. Özil (0,63 xT, 21 % du total de son équipe).","keys":["Geste le plus menaçant {T:home:de} : une passe signée O. Norwood à la 71e minute (+0,04 xT).","Geste le plus menaçant {T:away:de} : une passe signée M. Özil à la 7e minute (+0,14 xT)."],"impact":"La menace a payé : {T:away:sub} a fait avancer le ballon plus dangereusement, et le score a suivi."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 0.36 for {T:home:sub}, 3.06 for {T:away:sub}. The man moving the ball towards danger: M. Özil (0.63 xT, 21% of his team's total).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by O. Norwood in minute 71 (+0.04 xT).","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by M. Özil in minute 7 (+0.14 xT)."],"impact":"Threat pa